@baseUrl = https://localhost:7174
@token = PASTE_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
@studentId = 1

### View personal information
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/students/{{studentId}}/profile/personal-information
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Update personal information
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/students/{{studentId}}/profile/personal-information
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "alternateEmail": "student.personal@example.com",
  "alternateMobile": "9000000099",
  "city": "Hyderabad",
  "district": "Hyderabad",
  "state": "Telangana",
  "country": "India",
  "pincode": "500001",
  "changeReason": "Student updated personal contact details"
}

### Future Examination/Results integration contract
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/students/{{studentId}}/profile/exam-results
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
